Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.24,0:01:08.50,OP_JP_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}困難、迷わないなんて誰にでもできない
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.37,0:01:17.76,OP_JP_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}ああ、踏み出す足が君の導になる
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.38,0:01:24.15,OP_JP_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}一切合切無くなってしまっても
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.15,0:01:28.29,OP_JP_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}まだ君は君だという
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.27,0:01:32.54,OP_JP_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}何一つ消えないから
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.90,0:01:38.61,OP_JP_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}遠く離れてしまったとしても
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.03,0:01:42.37,OP_JP_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}振り向かず歩こう
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.78,0:01:45.94,OP_JP_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}明日は明日の風が吹く
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.29,0:01:51.00,OP_JP_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}誰にも追いつけない
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.67,0:00:41.60,OP_CH_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}被噩梦般的日子压得喘不过气
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.60,0:00:48.35,OP_CH_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}但是哭泣只会让人停滞不前
Dialogue: 1,0:00:48.98,0:00:55.11,OP_CH_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}自己的世界  由自己做主
Dialogue: 1,0:00:55.11,0:01:02.24,OP_CH_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}道路的前方  神明也不知晓
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.24,0:01:08.50,OP_CH_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}身处困境  任谁都会迷茫
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.37,0:01:17.76,OP_CH_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}踏出的步伐  就是你前进的路标
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.38,0:01:24.15,OP_CH_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}就算失去一切
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.15,0:01:28.29,OP_CH_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}你还是那个你
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.27,0:01:32.54,OP_CH_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}在记忆中永不消逝
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.90,0:01:38.61,OP_CH_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}所以即便已经相隔两地
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.03,0:01:42.37,OP_CH_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}也要径直向前走
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.78,0:01:45.94,OP_CH_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}明天有着明天的风
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.29,0:01:51.00,OP_CH_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}谁也追赶不上
