Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.30,0:22:31.37,ED_JP_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\3c&HA19784&\bord1}どうして　また目を覚ますの？
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.37,0:22:39.97,ED_JP_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\3c&HA19784&\bord1}食べかけの林檎　あの日の切なさが　ころがってる
Dialogue: 1,0:22:40.76,0:22:43.19,ED_JP_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\3c&HA19784&\bord1}心が（心が）
Dialogue: 1,0:22:43.19,0:22:45.51,ED_JP_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\3c&HA19784&\bord1}震えるわ（震えるわ）
Dialogue: 1,0:22:45.51,0:22:48.89,ED_JP_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\3c&HA19784&\bord1}気づいた　失いたくない　幸せ
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.14,0:22:58.86,ED_JP_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\3c&HA19784&\bord1}光や　ためらいや　笑顔や　涙が眩しい
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.86,0:23:09.29,ED_JP_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\3c&HA19784&\bord1}ホントの　美しさは　映せない　Mirror Mirror
Dialogue: 1,0:23:11.67,0:23:19.86,ED_JP_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\3c&HA19784&\bord1}Love is a potion. It can be medicine or poison.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:21.21,0:23:28.45,ED_JP_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\3c&HA19784&\bord1}Life is a potion. Grow with experience.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.74,0:22:26.85,ED_CHT_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\3c&HA19784&\bord1}剛才  生命已經迎來了終點
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.30,0:22:31.37,ED_CHT_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\3c&HA19784&\bord1}為甚麼又醒來了呢？
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.37,0:22:39.97,ED_CHT_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\3c&HA19784&\bord1}吃到一半的蘋果  那一天的悲傷  還歷歷在目
Dialogue: 1,0:22:40.76,0:22:43.19,ED_CHT_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\3c&HA19784&\bord1}我的心（我的心）
Dialogue: 1,0:22:43.19,0:22:45.51,ED_CHT_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\3c&HA19784&\bord1}在顫抖（在顫抖）
Dialogue: 1,0:22:45.51,0:22:48.89,ED_CHT_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\3c&HA19784&\bord1}我意識到了  那是我不想失去幸福
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.14,0:22:58.86,ED_CHT_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\3c&HA19784&\bord1}光芒  猶豫  笑臉  淚水  都是那麼的耀眼
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.86,0:23:09.29,ED_CHT_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\3c&HA19784&\bord1}鏡子照不出真正的美麗
Dialogue: 1,0:23:11.67,0:23:19.86,ED_CHT_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\3c&HA19784&\bord1}愛是一劑藥劑  它可以是藥也可以是毒
Dialogue: 1,0:23:21.21,0:23:28.45,ED_CHT_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\3c&HA19784&\bord1}人生是一劑藥劑  在經歷中獲得成長
